// Where the sandbox's characters may be: the `bodies_in_world` invariant halts the game when
// one ends a tick elsewhere. Inside means over what the built layouts cover on the ground
// (the arena and its corridor, x -21.5..44; the obstacle course, x 44..141.5, z -17.5..17.5)
// or over the loaded region's cells (the wilds: x -64..64, z 48..176), `margin` meters wider,
// and above `fall_below` (the canyon floor under the course's cliff is at -10).
{
    "world": (
        margin: 4.0,
        fall_below: -30.0,
    ),
}
